.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-modules-cycle 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-modules\-cycle \- Print how many modules the largest cycle of the module graph holds, refusing more than \-\-max
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten modules cycle\fR [\fB\-\-root\fR] [\fB\-\-max\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print how many modules the largest cycle of the module graph holds, refusing more than \-\-max
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-root\fR \fI<root>\fR
The crate\*(Aqs source root, the directory holding lib.rs
.TP
\fB\-\-max\fR \fI<max>\fR
Refuse when the largest cycle holds more than this many modules (a non\-negative integer)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
